    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active Product2 records with no PricebookEntry on the standard pricebook (or any active pricebook).
Why it matters: The product can&apos;t be added to opportunities or quotes — sales tries to add it and gets a &quot;not on this pricebook&quot; error. Looks active in the catalog but is unsellable.
Suppress a finding: for products intentionally restricted from sale (asset-only, internal-use SKUs).
Disable the detector: only if your org uses contracted prices or rate cards exclusively. Most CPQ orgs should leave this on.</value></values>
